WEBVTT

NOTE en_md5 a26df9872fb37da3ea6ffd743faaaa6f

00:00:00.380 --> 00:00:02.420
Karibu tena. Katika video hii, tutaangalia

00:00:02.480 --> 00:00:05.020
jinsi unavyoweza kupata herufi fulani

00:00:05.060 --> 00:00:08.640
katika string. Fikiria una

00:00:08.680 --> 00:00:11.040
jina langu, Jeremy, na unataka kuchukua

00:00:11.060 --> 00:00:14.120
herufi yangu ya kwanza, J, kutoka humo.

00:00:14.160 --> 00:00:17.300
Tutaifanyaje hiyo? Basi, unaweza

00:00:17.320 --> 00:00:19.620
kufikiria string kama mfululizo

00:00:19.660 --> 00:00:24.960
wa herufi. Kwa hivyo Jeremy ina herufi sita, J-E-R-E-M-Y,

00:00:25.980 --> 00:00:28.540
na kila moja ina nafasi yake. J iko

00:00:28.600 --> 00:00:30.270
katika nafasi ya kwanza, Y iko katika

00:00:30.320 --> 00:00:34.480
nafasi ya mwisho. Sasa, katika JavaScript na lugha nyingi

00:00:34.520 --> 00:00:38.240
za programu, nafasi hizi zinaanza na sifuri. Kwa hivyo

00:00:38.360 --> 00:00:41.769
herufi ya kwanza, J, iko katika nafasi ya sifuri,

00:00:41.780 --> 00:00:43.510
kisha tunapata E, ambayo iko

00:00:43.520 --> 00:00:46.780
katika nafasi ya moja, R katika mbili, E katika tatu,

00:00:46.900 --> 00:00:50.380
M katika nne, na Y katika tano. Sasa,

00:00:50.420 --> 00:00:52.700
hili suala la kuanza na sifuri ni la ajabu sana,

00:00:52.720 --> 00:00:54.660
na kwa kweli, maisha yangekuwa rahisi

00:00:54.700 --> 00:00:57.360
kama tungeanza kuhesabu kutoka moja, kama

00:00:57.380 --> 00:01:00.660
katika ulimwengu wa kawaida. Lakini hatufanyi hivyo. Katika lugha

00:01:00.700 --> 00:01:04.140
nyingi za programu, tunaanza kuhesabu kutoka sifuri,

00:01:04.160 --> 00:01:06.640
kwa hivyo unahitaji tu kujifunza hilo. Kwa hivyo,

00:01:06.680 --> 00:01:08.220
kama tunataka kuchukua herufi

00:01:08.260 --> 00:01:12.730
katika nafasi fulani, tunaweza kutumia mabano ya mraba

00:01:12.760 --> 00:01:16.560
tukiweka namba ndani yake. Kwa hivyo tukisema Jeremy,

00:01:16.940 --> 00:01:19.860
mabano ya mraba yenye sifuri ndani, tunamaanisha

00:01:20.120 --> 00:01:22.340
nipe herufi ya kwanza ya neno

00:01:22.420 --> 00:01:26.200
Jeremy. Tukisema Jeremy, mabano ya mraba moja,

00:01:26.760 --> 00:01:30.460
tunamaanisha nipe herufi ya pili. Na

00:01:30.500 --> 00:01:32.960
tunaweza kufanya hivi na variable pia. Kwa hivyo,

00:01:32.980 --> 00:01:34.990
tukitengeneza variable inayoitwa name na

00:01:35.040 --> 00:01:38.020
kuweka thamani yake kuwa string Jeremy, basi

00:01:38.040 --> 00:01:41.700
tunaweza kufanya name, mabano ya mraba sifuri, na

00:01:41.740 --> 00:01:44.940
tutapata J tena. Jambo moja la

00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:47.720
kuelewa wazi: unachopata kutoka name,

00:01:47.820 --> 00:01:52.080
mabano ya mraba sifuri, ni string nyingine tu.

00:01:52.120 --> 00:01:53.980
Ni karatasi nyingine iliyo na J

00:01:54.020 --> 00:01:56.700
juu yake. Hakuna kitu cha kipekee kuhusu hiyo. Ni

00:01:56.820 --> 00:01:59.600
string kama vile Jeremy ilivyo string.

00:01:59.640 --> 00:02:01.200
Inatokea tu kwamba ina herufi moja

00:02:01.260 --> 00:02:04.400
badala ya sita. Na kufanya hivi hakuathiri

00:02:04.440 --> 00:02:06.500
string ya awali hata kidogo. Hatuondoi

00:02:06.660 --> 00:02:09.250
J wala kufanya kitu kama hicho. Tunachagua

00:02:09.280 --> 00:02:11.860
tu, tunatafuta ni herufi ipi

00:02:11.940 --> 00:02:14.489
tunayotaka, kisha tunatengeneza string mpya

00:02:14.520 --> 00:02:19.140
yenye herufi hiyo ndani. Katika zoezi linalofuata,

00:02:19.220 --> 00:02:23.800
utahitaji kutumia hili kujenga kifupisho. Kila la

00:02:23.840 --> 00:02:25.560
heri, na tutaonana hapa tena hivi karibuni.
